    <iconUrl>https://download.uipath.com/UI_icon.png?system</iconUrl>
    <description>IMPORTANT: This package version requires Studio v2022.10 or above. Installing it on versions lower than recommended may cause unexpected issues in your workflows.
      Core activities enable robots to manipulate data stored in UiPath Data Service. These activities allow you to execute operations such as create, update, read, search or delete on records stored in Data Service Entities.</description>
    <tags>UiPathActivities</tags>
